  <data name="ConnectionHintHostKeyMismatch" xml:space="preserve"><value>This server's identity differs from the one on record. The connection was blocked. Do not continue until whoever administers the server confirms the key really changed.</value></data>
  <data name="ConnectionHintUnsupportedAlgorithm" xml:space="preserve"><value>The server only offers old SSH algorithms that ServerAlyzer does not accept. Ask whoever administers the server to update OpenSSH or enable current algorithms.</value></data>
