  <data name="ConnectionHintConnectionTimedOut" xml:space="preserve"><value>The server did not answer in time. Check the address and the port, and that a firewall (ufw, iptables or the router) lets the SSH port through.</value></data>
  <data name="ConnectionHintRemoteDisconnected" xml:space="preserve"><value>The server closed the connection early. Retest; if it keeps happening, the server may be limiting connections (MaxStartups, fail2ban).</value></data>
